00:32.862 --> 00:34.655
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.724 --> 00:36.758
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:36.827 --> 00:38.896
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.965 --> 00:40.241
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.310 --> 00:42.103
SquarePants!
方裤！

