- 击球！

01:03.448 --> 01:06.379
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:06.448 --> 01:09.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:09.172 --> 01:11.379
Ah!
啊!

01:11.448 --> 01:13.517
Ah, oh.
啊，哦。

01:13.586 --> 01:14.586
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:14.655 --> 01:18.241
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:18.310 --> 01:23.068
- I got it, I got it.
- 我明白了，我明白了。

01:23.137 --> 01:26.344
- Wah!
- 哇！

01:26.413 --> 01:29.517
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

01:29.586 --> 01:31.655
Whoo-hoo!
- [laughs]
呼呼！
- [笑]

01:31.724 --> 01:34.000
[laughing and cheering]
[笑声和欢呼]

01:40.137 --> 01:41.344
- [laughing]
- [笑]

01:41.413 --> 01:45.000
- What are you two dizzy
dingbats doing out here?
- 你们两个晕什么啊
dingbats 在这里做什么？

01:45.068 --> 01:47.896
- Just treasuring our time
together, Squidward.
- 只是珍惜我们的时间
一起，章鱼哥。

01:47.965 --> 01:50.758
- Well, that time is over.
- 好吧，那段时间已经结束了。

01:50.827 --> 01:53.068
Say good night,
go to your separate houses,
说晚安，
go to your separate houses,

01:53.137 --> 01:54.448
and be quiet!
保持安静！

01:54.517 --> 01:58.034
[both whimpering]
[两人都呜咽]

01:58.103 --> 01:59.551
- I can't do it!
- 我做不到！

01:59.620 --> 02:02.413
I can't be away
from my best friend.
我不能离开
来自我最好的朋友。

02:02.482 --> 02:04.137
- No, it hurts too much!
- 不，太痛了！

02:04.206 --> 02:05.241
[both crying]
[两人都哭了]

02:05.310 --> 02:08.137
- Oh, will you two
cut it out?
- 噢，你们两个愿意吗？
剪掉它吗？

02:08.206 --> 02:11.172
- Cut it out...
- 剪掉它...

02:11.241 --> 02:14.172
Squidward,
that's a great idea!
章鱼哥，
这是个好主意！

02:14.241 --> 02:15.448
both: It is?
两人：是吗？

02:15.517 --> 02:16.931
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:21.551 --> 02:23.275
- Wow!
- 哇！

02:23.344 --> 02:25.000
My turn!
轮到我了！

02:25.068 --> 02:27.551
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:27.620 --> 02:29.551
[chuckles]
[笑声]

02:29.620 --> 02:32.000
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

02:32.068 --> 02:34.206
-[groans]
-[呻吟]

02:34.275 --> 02:35.379
- Aww.
- 哇。

02:35.448 --> 02:38.379
[both chittering]
[两人都叽叽喳喳]

02:38.448 --> 02:41.448
- I think I'm gonna be sick.
- 我想我会生病的。

02:41.517 --> 02:42.931
- Here you go, Patrick.
- 给你，帕特里克。

02:43.000 --> 02:45.172
Now we never have
to be apart,
现在我们从来没有
分开，

02:45.241 --> 02:47.241
even when
we're not together.
即使当
我们没有在一起。

02:47.310 --> 02:48.551
- This is great.
- 这太棒了。

02:48.620 --> 02:50.758
See you forever, SpongeBob.
永远再见，海绵宝宝。

02:50.827 --> 02:53.931
- Yeah, see you forever,
Patrick.
- 是的，永远再见，
帕特里克.

02:55.413 --> 02:56.586
[yawns]
[哈欠]

02:56.655 --> 02:58.344
Time for bed, Tiny Patrick.
该睡觉了，小帕特里克。

02:58.413 --> 03:01.379
- [cheering, laughing]
- [欢呼，大笑]

03:04.241 --> 03:06.620
- [gurgling]
- [咯咯声]

03:06.689 --> 03:09.758
- [indistinct shouting]
- [隐隐约约的喊叫]

03:09.827 --> 03:13.103
[laughing]
[笑]

03:16.310 --> 03:18.482
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:18.551 --> 03:21.034
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

03:21.103 --> 03:22.793
- Hmm.
- 唔。

03:24.448 --> 03:26.551
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

03:26.620 --> 03:28.724
- Uh. Oh.
- 呃。哦。

03:28.793 --> 03:30.275
- Ah.
- 啊。

03:30.344 --> 03:33.034
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:33.103 --> 03:35.206
- Ah!
- 啊！

03:36.896 --> 03:39.103
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

03:40.517 --> 03:42.724
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

03:44.551 --> 03:47.206
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

03:47.275 --> 03:49.896
Good morning, Squidward.
- Says who?
早上好，章鱼哥。
- 谁说的？

03:49.965 --> 03:52.793
- [chuckles] You sit right
there, my hungry little sailor,
- [轻笑]你坐对了
在那里，我饥饿的小水手，

03:52.862 --> 03:54.827
while I whip you up some grub
from the galley.
当我给你准备一些食物时
从厨房。

03:54.896 --> 03:57.206
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

03:57.275 --> 03:58.482
- Dah, uh-huh.
- 啊哈。

03:58.551 --> 04:01.862
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

04:03.827 --> 04:05.724
- Ah.
- 啊。

04:05.793 --> 04:08.000
[excited laughing]
[兴奋大笑]

04:10.551 --> 04:12.482
Ahh.
啊。

04:12.551 --> 04:15.241
Hmm?
唔？

04:15.310 --> 04:17.586
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

04:17.655 --> 04:18.758
Ahhh!
啊啊！

04:18.827 --> 04:20.172
Yah!
啊！

04:20.241 --> 04:22.448
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:22.517 --> 04:25.586
- Huh?
Careful there, little buddy.
- 啊？
小心一点，小伙伴。

04:25.655 --> 04:27.931
The grill is hot.
烤架很热。

04:31.586 --> 04:33.068
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:33.137 --> 04:35.586
Ohhh.
噢。

04:35.655 --> 04:38.310
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:38.379 --> 04:40.896
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:40.965 --> 04:42.413
- [straining]
Huh?
- [紧张]
啊？

04:42.482 --> 04:44.827
- Whee-ah!
- 呼啊！

04:44.896 --> 04:46.379
- Stop!
- 停止！

04:46.448 --> 04:48.551
Bad, Tiny Patrick.
坏了，小帕特里克。

04:48.620 --> 04:50.000
Hmm.
唔。

04:50.068 --> 04:51.931
Sorry to do this, little guy,
很抱歉这样做，小家伙，

04:52.000 --> 04:54.379
but I have to keep you safe
while I get some work done.
但我必须保证你的安全
当我完成一些工作时。

04:54.448 --> 04:55.586
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

04:55.655 --> 04:57.482
- Ah-yah.
- 啊耶。

04:57.551 --> 04:59.931
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:02.448 --> 05:04.689
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

05:04.758 --> 05:07.000
[snoring]
[打鼾]

