05:17.137 --> 05:19.379
- Good morning.
- 早上好。

05:19.448 --> 05:21.172
- [excited cheer]
- [兴奋欢呼]

05:21.241 --> 05:23.206
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:23.275 --> 05:25.689
Aah.
啊。

05:25.758 --> 05:28.241
[gulps]
[吞咽]

05:28.310 --> 05:31.655
Didn't think I was gonna
