Brushy, brushy, brushy.
- [嗡嗡声]
刷毛，刷毛，刷毛。

05:38.586 --> 05:40.724
- Come on, Tiny SpongeBob.
- 来吧，小海绵宝宝。

05:40.793 --> 05:43.241
You gotta lift
