with Tiny Patrick here.
但我已经有了一些计划
和小帕特里克在这里。

06:12.103 --> 06:15.931
- Oh, yeah, well,
me and Tiny SpongeBob,
- 哦，是的，好吧，
我和小海绵宝宝

06:16.000 --> 06:19.034
we're pretty busy tonight,
so good night.
今晚我们很忙
晚安。

06:19.103 --> 06:20.482
- Good night.
- 晚安。

06:20.551 --> 06:23.068
- [straining,
frantic chittering]
- [紧张，
疯狂的叽叽喳喳]

06:23.137 --> 06:27.103
- [upset chittering]
- [心烦意乱的叽叽喳喳声]

06:27.172 --> 06:29.275
- I don't want you getting
into trouble during the night,
- 我不想让你得到
晚上遇到麻烦，

06:29.344 --> 06:31.310
so you're gonna stay
in the aquarium
所以你会留下来
在水族馆里

06:31.379 --> 06:33.482
like a good little
sleepy clam.
像一个好小
瞌睡的蛤蜊。

06:33.551 --> 06:35.482
- Ahh!
- 啊！

06:35.551 --> 06:36.862
[straining]
[紧张]

06:36.931 --> 06:38.517
Ahhh!
啊啊！

06:39.689 --> 06:41.931
[angry grunting]
[愤怒的咕哝]

06:46.896 --> 06:49.103
- [grunting, straining]
- [咕哝，紧张]

06:54.413 --> 06:56.448
- Huh? Hey.
- 啊？嘿。

06:56.517 --> 07:02.000
Didn't you used to have
one, two...two arms?
你以前不是有过吗
一只、两只……两只手臂？

07:02.068 --> 07:04.896
Okay, little buddy.
好吧，小伙伴。

07:04.965 --> 07:07.206
Let's find that arm of yours.
让我们找到你的手臂。

07:07.275 --> 07:10.448
Oh.
[grumbles]
哦。
[抱怨]

07:10.517 --> 07:12.689
Nope.
没有。

07:12.758 --> 07:15.034
Nope.
Hmm.
没有。
唔。

07:15.103 --> 07:16.724
Huh?
- Ah!
啊？
- 啊！

07:16.793 --> 07:19.517
- Nope. Oh.
- 没有。哦。

07:19.586 --> 07:21.793
Ah-ha!
I got it!
啊哈！
我得到了它！

07:21.862 --> 07:23.517
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

07:23.586 --> 07:25.379
[straining]
[紧张]

07:25.448 --> 07:28.448
- I'll fix you up
in no time.
- 我会收拾你的
很快。

07:28.517 --> 07:29.965
- [chittering]
- [叽叽喳喳]

07:30.034 --> 07:31.793
- Good as new.
- 完好如新。

07:31.862 --> 07:34.068
- Ehh.
Huh?
- 呃。
啊？

07:36.172 --> 07:39.310
- Okay, good night.
- 好吧，晚安。

07:39.379 --> 07:42.034
[snoring]
[打鼾]

07:42.103 --> 07:43.517
- Huh?
- 啊？

07:43.586 --> 07:45.000
[snapping]
[啪啪啪]

07:45.068 --> 07:46.586
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

07:46.655 --> 07:48.689
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

07:50.655 --> 07:52.551
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

07:52.620 --> 07:54.275
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

07:54.344 --> 07:56.793
- [straining]
Oh?
- [紧张]
哦？

07:56.862 --> 07:58.448
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:58.517 --> 08:01.068
[straining]
[紧张]

08:01.137 --> 08:02.827
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:02.896 --> 08:04.241
Ding!
叮！

08:04.310 --> 08:06.448
- [excited grunting]
- Yah!
- [兴奋的咕哝]
- 啊！

08:06.517 --> 08:09.103
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:09.172 --> 08:11.172
- [snores, mumbles]
- [打鼾，咕哝]

08:11.241 --> 08:13.689
Yes, Squidward,
extra mayo, I heard you.
是的，章鱼哥，
额外的蛋黄酱，我听到了。

08:13.758 --> 08:17.655
[both whimper]
[两人都呜咽]

08:22.310 --> 08:25.137
[both grumble]
[两人都抱怨]

08:26.827 --> 08:28.034
- [groans softly]
- [轻声呻吟]

08:28.103 --> 08:29.172
[confused grunts]
[困惑的咕哝声]

08:29.241 --> 08:31.068
Oh, hi, Patrick.
哦，嗨，帕特里克。

08:31.137 --> 08:32.862
