a sleepover last night.
- 我不记得我们有过
昨晚过夜。

08:36.344 --> 08:38.551
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

08:44.551 --> 08:46.000
[both cheering]
[两人欢呼]

08:46.068 --> 08:48.137
- What's going on, SpongeBob?
- 发生什么事了，海绵宝宝？

08:48.206 --> 08:50.068
- Oh, hey, little guys.
- 哦，嘿，小家伙们。

08:50.137 --> 08:52.758
You're playing with each other.
So cute.
你们在互相玩耍。
太可爱了。

08:52.827 --> 08:55.172
[both grumble]
[两人都抱怨]

08:55.241 --> 08:56.724
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:01.689 --> 09:03.724
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:10.551 --> 09:11.620
[explosion]
[爆炸]

09:11.689 --> 09:14.000
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:14.068 --> 09:16.517
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:19.448 --> 09:21.482
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:22.689 --> 09:23.827
- Whew.
- 呼。

09:23.896 --> 09:25.965
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:26.034 --> 09:27.689
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

09:27.758 --> 09:29.965
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

09:30.034 --> 09:32.241
- Ah, ah.
- 啊，啊。

09:32.310 --> 09:35.103
[exciting chittering]
[激动人心的叽叽喳喳声]

09:37.620 --> 09:38.827
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

09:38.896 --> 09:42.068
-[straining]
-[紧张]

09:43.034 --> 09:44.793
[grunts]
Hey!
[咕哝]
嘿！

09:44.862 --> 09:47.068
[excited chittering]
[兴奋的叽叽喳喳声]

09:50.068 --> 09:52.448
- What are they doing,
SpongeBob?
- 他们在做什么，
海绵宝宝？

09:52.517 --> 09:54.517
- Just trying to live
their lives, Patrick.
- 只是想努力生活
他们的生活，帕特里克。

09:54.586 --> 09:57.827
Just trying to live
their lives.
只是想努力生活
他们的生活。

09:57.896 --> 09:59.241
Poor little guys.
可怜的小家伙们。

09:59.310 --> 10:01.517
- [straining]
- [紧张]

10:03.310 --> 10:05.758
- Our world is just too big
for them.
- 我们的世界太大了
对于他们来说。

10:05.827 --> 10:07.931
Ohh, I have an idea.
哦，我有一个想法。

10:08.000 --> 10:11.793
- Oh, I hope it's not
another one of your crazy plans
- 哦，我希望不是这样
你的另一个疯狂计划

10:11.862 --> 10:15.000
to steal the Krappy Patty
secret formula.
偷克拉皮帕蒂
秘密配方。

10:15.068 --> 10:16.724
- You're thinking
of Plankton, Patrick.
- 你在想
浮游生物，帕特里克。

10:16.793 --> 10:18.827
- Oh, yeah!
- 哦，是的！

10:20.724 --> 10:22.827
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

10:25.724 --> 10:27.034
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

10:27.103 --> 10:29.827
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:29.896 --> 10:31.103
- Ta-da!
- 哒哒！

10:31.172 --> 10:33.413
A tiny home
for my tiny friend.
一个小家
为了我的小朋友。

10:33.482 --> 10:35.758
- Ahh!
[chuckles]
- 啊！
[笑声]

10:35.827 --> 10:37.068
- [happy gibberish]
- [快乐的胡言乱语]

10:37.137 --> 10:39.758
- Oh, I get it.
- 哦，我明白了。

10:41.862 --> 10:43.344
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:43.413 --> 10:46.310
- Nice work, Patrick.
Whoops!
- 干得好，帕特里克。
哎呀！

10:46.379 --> 10:49.172
Almost forgot.
差点忘了。

10:49.241 --> 10:50.724
You've got to have
a Gare-Bear.
你必须有
车站熊。

10:50.793 --> 10:52.068
- Oh, yay!
- 哦，耶！

10:52.137 --> 10:53.586
- Ohh. Huh?
- 哦。啊？

10:53.655 --> 10:55.689
[chuckles]
[笑声]

10:59.000 --> 11:01.034
both: Aww.
两人：哇哦。

11:01.103 --> 11:03.793
- Hmm.
- 唔。

11:03.862 --> 11:05.034
Hmm?
唔？

11:05.103 --> 11:07.310
- Let's leave 'em alone,
Patrick.
- 让我们别打扰他们吧
帕特里克.

11:11.655 --> 11:13.689
[both chittering]
[两人都叽叽喳喳]

11:24.862 --> 11:26.137
- [straining]
- [紧张]

11:26.206 --> 11:27.517
Ugh, too bright.
呃，太亮了。

11:27.586 --> 11:29.034
[exciting chittering]
[激动人心的叽叽喳喳声]

11:29.103 --> 11:32.655
Oh, those two again.
噢，又是那两个人。

11:32.724 --> 11:34.931
What the--
什么是——

11:35.000 --> 11:36.310
[groans]
[呻吟]

11:36.379 --> 11:38.448
[excited chittering]
[兴奋的叽叽喳喳声]

11:38.517 --> 11:40.862
Ow!
[grumbles]
噢！
[抱怨]

11:40.931 --> 11:42.310
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

11:42.379 --> 11:44.862
- No, get away.
Get away!
- 不，走开。
逃离！

11:44.931 --> 11:47.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

[尖叫]